    "notes": {
        "2e7a2a5b-b144-4ec1-bef7-f8f17243d886": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 640,
            "width": 900,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nBoth lanes are scoped to `E2E-Delta-Triggers/DeletedFile` in the **Documents** library of the **Stg Appmixer QA**\nSharePoint site. Create that folder with `appmixer.microsoft.sharepoint.CreateFolder`\n(parent path `E2E-Delta-Triggers`) on a fresh tenant.\n\nThe provoking Make API Call deletes the file this flow uploaded, so it doubles as the cleanup —\nthere is nothing left behind and no cleanup component after AfterAll.\n\n`Wait 1m` lets the Graph subscription propagate before the file is created and `Wait 2m` keeps the\ncreate and the delete in separate delta pages. Do not remove either.\n\nThe account needs `Files.Read.All`, `Sites.Read.All`, `Subscription.Read.All` (trigger),\n`Files.ReadWrite.All` (upload) and `Sites.ReadWrite.All` (Make API Call)."
        }
